    title: "boundary_ruling has no value for 'one boundary always, the other environment-conditioned': builtins.help (logging always, pydoc pager launch on a tty) re-opens the unruled register, and its no-argument stdin loop is disclosed rather than rowed"  # 43a9
    status: todo_hard  # 43a9
